Tools: Verilator 5.020 2024-01-01 rev (Debian 5.020-1); Yosys 0.33 (git sha1 2584903a060); sv2v sv2v v0.0.12

== 0. Portability scan: size casts inside array indices
A size cast N'(x) keeps the signedness of x (IEEE 1800-2017 6.24.1): 3'(4) is -4, an index
outside every array that Riviera-PRO and xsim drop, while Verilator 5.020 uses the bits (D30).
Portability scan: none found

