Changes since the 5 Nov pre-check (issue of 6 Nov): tb_router.sv indexes its port queue through pq()/pv(),
which return unsigned values, and checks that every packet is queued (one more check per packet, so the
R01-R04 counts above are higher than on 5 Nov). results/precheck/B1_mutation.log was run with the 5 Nov
tb_router.sv; on Verilator the 6 Nov testbench behaves the same, so every mutant listed there is still caught.
